  backgroundImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 90a2fb1494bfac24fa5ea3c263c6a254, type: 3}
  loadingText: 'BELLONA [Sector 5]

    This war torn air space belongs to Bellona.
    The scum that remain of that rebel group we''ve been at odds with are hiding
    out here. They may be planning a big retaliation, and we got some intel that
    they''re stashing some bombs nearby. You must take anything that could be used
    against us, so maybe we can make use of them instead. Yes, these are active space
    mines, and no, we don''t care. You''re expendable, remember? If you really care
    that much, just make sure not to hit them too hard. '
